  "conclusion": "At C32, the trace-off workload completes 320/320 requests at 52.44-ms mean ITL. The largest PA idle interval is a 0.714-ms/layer wait for Projection to produce next-layer QKV, but it grows only 0.055 ms from the shorter C12 trace while paged Attention grows 0.164 ms. High-concurrency ITL growth is therefore dominated by real Attention work rather than local-fast copies, metadata preparation, or a newly enlarged control-plane idle gap.",
